{"id":"c7f202b538b169b2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-martin-high.md","title":"Martin 的 high 支配定理","display":"thm-martin-high — Martin 的 high 支配定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-martin-high","aliases":["20-thm-martin-high"],"display":"thm-martin-high — Martin 的 high 支配定理","chapter":"4","section":"4.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 4.5.6","source_pdf_pages":[133],"source_printed_pages":[97],"depends_on":["[[20-df-domination]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-martin-high"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-martin-high</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-martin-high — Martin 的 high 支配定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.5.6"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>133</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>97</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 为任意 oracle。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martin\\text{-}high}\\vdash\n\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\le_TA&#39;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{Dominant}(f)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martin\\text{-}high}\\vdash\n\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\le_TA&#39;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{Dominant}(f)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>high 的支配函数必须由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 本身计算，原稿的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\le_TA&#39;\">\\(f\\le_TA&#39;\\)</span> 条件过弱。正向用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算的 Tot 近似选择足够长的模拟阶段；反向用支配函数建立 Tot 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算极限近似。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.5.6；印刷页 97；PDF 第 133 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","ex